/ Places shaded by Drucksachen per resident, with the legend. choropleth is a
/ Choropleth, url gives a shape's page, bounds the box to show and unit what
/ the shapes are ("Stadtteil", "Bezirk"). A box with a missing corner (seeds
/ set none) would fit the map to 0°, 0°, so the map fits its shapes instead.
- bounds = [] if bounds.flatten.any?(&:nil?)
div data-controller='choropleth' data-choropleth-features-value=choropleth.features(url).to_json data-choropleth-bounds-value=bounds.to_json
  .choropleth.rounded.border data-choropleth-target='container'
.small.text-secondary.mt-2
  ' Drucksachen je 10.000 Menschen, die im #{unit} wohnen:
ul.list-inline.small.mb-0
  - choropleth.shades.each do |shade|
    li.list-inline-item.me-3
      span.legend-swatch style="background-color: #{shade.color}"
      = shade.label
  - if choropleth.no_rate?
    li.list-inline-item
      span.legend-swatch style="background-color: #{Choropleth::NO_RATE}"
      ' zu wenige Einwohner
